---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Request sent — LevelSelect"
  description="Your invite request reached LevelSelect."
>
<main class="wrap">
  <article class="doc">
    <h1>That's through</h1>
    <p class="lede">I'll send the TestFlight invite to the address you gave me. It comes from a person, not a queue, so it may be a day.</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <p><strong>When it arrives:</strong> install TestFlight from the App Store if you don't have it, then open the invite on the device you want to play with. Your library is yours — it syncs through your own iCloud, and nothing about it reaches me.</p>
    </div>

    <p>While you wait, <a href="/changelog/">what's shipped so far</a> and <a href="/roadmap/">where it's going</a>. If you'd rather not wait to say something, <a href="mailto:support@levelselect.app">support@levelselect.app</a> reaches the same person.</p>
  </article>
</main>

<style>
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.06rem; max-width: 42ch; }
</style>
</Base>
